  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of the normal at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cosec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(given)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
